          "id": 3755184861,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "So the same issue that, for Darwin-based OSes, is handled by specifying a \"minimum deployment platform\" OS version when building - and being prepared to have to deal with OS features present in the OS on which you built but not in the OS on which the code's being deployed?",
