      "title": "WiX: Don't include the Visual C++ Redistributable merge modules",
      "message": "WiX: Don't include the Visual C++ Redistributable merge modules\n\nVisual C++ Redistributable merge modules have been deprecated since\nVisual Studio 2019, and aren't available for Arm64. Instead of including\nthem, check for a required redistributable version and exit with an\nerror if it's not present.\n\nThis should make it easier to upgrade to newer versions of WiX and might\npave the way for Arm64 MSIs.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2026-08-28T15:39:18.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "Gerald Combs",
